WEBVTT

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.990
These are your new Porons...

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.500
Aiko's gonna be so happy...

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.920
Big Turnaround!? Ojamajos' Training.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:16.220
I'm home.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:16.980
Welcome home.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:18.910
Hey, hey, Doremi.

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:20.490
Do you know what we're having for dinner tonight?

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:25.930
It's steak!

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:27.620
Why? Year-end bonuses?

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.130
Nope, not a bonus.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.090
I won the lottery!

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:36.090
Wow! 10 million yen?

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:38.860
Are you an idiot?

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:42.820
With that much money, do you really think we would have having steak of all things?

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:44.180
Uh, I guess.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:45.260
Fifth place, 10,000 yen.

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:49.490
Fifth place is still fine because I get to eat steak!

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:51.230
Don't tell me...

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:56.000
Mom, are you still keeping that pendant around?

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.330
No way, I threw that away a long time ago.

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.450
Are you telling the truth?

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.450
If you don't believe me, then go see for yourself.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.120
Then it's fine.

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:09.310
Well then, please make our dinner.

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:12.420
Your father will be home soon, so go take a bath first.

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:15.340
I'm hungry!

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.380
I want to eat steak!

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:18.340
After your bath.

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:26.260
Then I'll eat the cake that I saved up.

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:30.470
Eh? That's strange.

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:32.840
Doremi!

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:34.770
You ate my cake again, didn't you?

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.730
No, it wasn't me.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.690
You ate my anpan roll last time, so you must have eaten it!

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:41.980
I told you that it wasn't me!

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:44.660
Don't tell me it was Majo Rika again...

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:47.120
I'll go look for evidence!

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:50.140
Wait right there, Pop!

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.060
This is pretty good.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.460
Wait right there, Pop!

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:01.010
Oh crap!

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.010
No!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.220
Out of my way!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:11.600
You did eat it! Here's the evidence!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:17.160
That Majo Rika...

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:18.150
If that's the case...

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:24.360
Well, since I've been caught, I'll give you a great present, Pop.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.320
A present?

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:35.210
Ta-da!

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:37.970
It's Plush-chan!

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:39.500
What are you doing, Doremi?

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.170
I found her just for you, Pop.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.480
Hey, give her to me now! Please!

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:45.160
Here.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.140
Thank you!

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:49.010
Plush-chan!

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.360
This thing is so hard and uncomfortable.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:56.230
Plush-chan's so soft and squishy!

00:04:56.230 --> 00:05:00.320
Doremi! Pop! Hurry up and take your baths!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.220
Okay!

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:03.740
Plush-chan, let's take a bath together.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.700
Doremi!

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:14.160
Hadzuki-chan, sorry to have you stay for so long.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.650
It's okay.

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:18.840
Anyway, Lala, what should we do now?

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:26.480
Well, if you can pass the level 6 exam, your magic will level up and then a chance will come.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:27.890
That's impossible.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:31.650
We used up all of our magic spheres helping Baaya.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.990
Hadzuki-chan, don't feel down.

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:37.770
With everyone's help, I'm sure we'll find a way.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.730
Yeah, you're right.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.070
Masaru-kun.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:05:59.920
Yo.

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:02.710
Your trumpet playing has gotten a lot better.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.210
Not really.

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:10.840
What's wrong? Is something the matter?

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.100
Yeah, a little.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:16.930
I don't know what it is that you lost,

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:22.020
but if it were me and something that important, I'd work part-time to get it back.

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:23.720
Work part-time, huh?

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:26.800
If that didn't work, then I would beg for it.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:29.490
But, you're a lady, Fujiwara so that probably wouldn't work.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:33.490
No, you helped me out a lot. Thank you, Masaru-kun.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:34.970
Not really.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:36.450
Later.

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:38.920
Thank you!

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:55.540
Oh no!

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.680
I can't make the Fa note anymore.

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:01.960
Also, where the heck is Dad?

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:04.520
Dad!

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:10.910
Dad, what's wrong?

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:14.680
It's nothin'. I'm just a little beat.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:17.510
On the way home, I felt like takin' a nice nap.

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:20.260
Thank goodness I only bumped into a few garbage cans.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:25.170
Dad, did you throw away that charm yet!?

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.800
Y-Yeah!

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.130
Aiko, hold up a sec!

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.760
I have somethin' fer you.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:33.400
Somethin' fer me?

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:36.680
Yeah! Aiko, you'll love it!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.880
Here, let's go back into the house.

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:40.330
'Kay, 'kay? Come on come on...

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:40.920
But...

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:45.820
Eh? For me?

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:50.740
Ya shouldn't have! It ain't even Christmas or my birthday.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.760
It's alright. Open it up and see.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:58.450
A harmonica! Super high quality too!

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.300
It's great, right?

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.900
It was the most expensive one at the store.

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:03.960
But how did you...

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:07.420
Yer other harmonica is already so old and fallin' apart.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.190
So I boughtcha a new one.

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:10.880
Wow! I'm so happy!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.530
C'mon, play somethin' fer me.

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.940
That's pretty nice.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.770
Well then.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.100
What are ya doing?

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:30.840
I'm just gonna toss out this ol' antique.

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:31.540
No!

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:33.100
What's wrong?

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:37.070
This harmonica has a lotta my best memories.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:39.990
It's my most precious treasure!

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:42.000
How can ya just throw that away!?

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:44.960
Ya don't need to get so mad.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.420
Did you forget already!?

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:50.460
I don't want this!

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.470
You're such an idiot, Dad!

00:08:57.310 --> 00:08:58.830
I-I'm sorry...

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:00.430
A... Aiko.

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.040
Don't touch me!

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.810
Dad I... Dad I...!

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.860
I hate you!

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:08.000
Aiko...

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:17.530
What's wrong with you, Dad...?

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:20.490
What happened, Dad!?

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:25.530
It was the first time I caught something like that, so I got careless.

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:28.260
I accidentally fell off the cliff.

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:29.840
Did you break it?

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.230
No, it's just a flesh wound.

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:34.010
Doremi must have gotten her clumsiness from Dad.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.110
Doremi, look.

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:44.180
Ah, the pendant!

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.070
Didn't you say that you threw it away already!?

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:48.370
Well, it's because...

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:50.100
If you don't throw it away, more bad things will happen!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.610
If you won't do it, I will!

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:57.590
It's too wasteful to throw it away!

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:59.740
You got to eat steak because of it!

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.240
Um... That was...

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.310
Hello, this is the Harukaze residence.

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:08.050
Oh, Hadzuki-chan.

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:09.640
Yes, she's here.

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:10.850
Doremi.

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:13.220
Hadzuki-chan? What's wrong?

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:16.170
Eh!? Ai-chan ran away from home!?

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.280
Cheer up, Ai-chan.

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:23.640
It's just a small harmonica, so why did you run away from home?

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:28.230
This harmonica ain't just any harmonica! It's...

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.830
It's...

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:35.030
The one that Dad and Mom bought for me, my most precious harmonica!

00:11:01.230 --> 00:11:05.590
It was before Dad and Mom divorced.

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:17.120
What's up, Aiko?

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.770
Do ya want a harmonica?

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:20.280
No, not really.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:22.200
Don't think ya can fool me.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.490
I can buy ya a harmonica.

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:28.660
Aiko wants this cute one.

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:30.560
Okay, I'll pay for it.

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:33.530
Now hold up, let me get this.

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:36.060
Oh my, this isn't something big.

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:37.050
It's the same whoever buys it.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.120
Ya idiot, I still have enough money to buy a harmonica.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:42.130
If you're gonna fight then I don't want it!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.110
Oh, Aiko.

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:45.210
I understand.

00:11:45.210 --> 00:11:48.020
Okay then, Mom and I will split the money in half.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:50.020
Then please buy it for me.

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:53.480
What a realistic girl.

00:11:56.430 --> 00:12:01.900
When they divorced, on the night my mom left, I was cryin' while holdin' onto this.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:05.210
I only had my harmonica to support me.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.400
Dad.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:23.990
Aiko...

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:26.440
I'm sorry to make you go through so much...

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:28.840
Please forgive me.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:30.640
Play this.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:33.640
If you play this, Aiko won't cry anymore.

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:36.610
Aiko...

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:40.500
Okay, I'll play it.

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:43.440
I'm an idiot, so I only know simple pieces.

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:44.570
I'll try my best!

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:28.040
Aiko!

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:30.040
Dad!

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:34.200
Mom's not with us anymore, but the two of us will hang in there!

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:37.170
But now, Dad is...

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:41.590
What's wrong? What happened?

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:46.040
I'm sorry to have put off that precious harmonica like that.

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:48.510
It's okay, it's a broken antique anyway.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:51.500
I love Ai-chan more and more.

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:54.260
Stop that, I'm gettin' embarrassed.

00:13:57.300 --> 00:14:01.940
My Lady, Aiko-sama's father is here to pick her up.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.610
I ain't goin' home!

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:04.450
Ai-chan.

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:07.040
It's better to have him worry.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:07.910
Baaya-san.

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:12.370
If ya throw away that charm, then I'll go home with ya! Idiot! Fool! Moron!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:15.120
Tell him that for me.

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:18.200
Of course, I understand.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:22.360
Ai-chan, your dad hasn't thrown away his magic item?

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:23.960
Yeah, Doremi-chan too?

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:27.420
Yeah, my mom said that it's a waste to throw it away.

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.650
But we don't have any more magic spheres.

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:33.930
There ain't way to disable everyone's magic goods.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.020
I think there is still a way.

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:43.860
Yada-kun told me that if there's something you really want, you should beg for it or go work part-time.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.340
Beg, eh...?

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:47.720
Work part-time, eh?

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:49.360
Yada-kun sure speaks his mind.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.760
Right?

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:55.830
It's no use sitting around worrying, so let's think of a way to get more magic spheres.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.420
Yer right.

00:14:57.420 --> 00:15:00.280
I got it! Let's go work part-time in the Witch World!

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.080
Good idea.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.620
But how will we get to the Witch World?

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:04.550
Majo Ruka and her goons are still at the Maho-dou.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.420
Oh yeah.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:10.560
If we don't use magic, we can't get to the Witch World.

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:14.640
If we don't go to the Witch World, we won't get any magical spheres.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:23.310
Hey! Where did the three of you go?

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.820
Dodo, why did you have this magic sphere?

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:37.740
That's the magic sphere that we lost!

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:40.430
Dodo! Good one!

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:43.670
Now we can go to the Witch World!

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:46.750
Okay! Let's go to the Maho-dou!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:51.870
If ya throw away that charm, then I'll go home with ya! Idiot! Fool! Moron!

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.260
That is what Aiko-sama told me.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:00.700
Let's get goin'.

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:01.230
Yeah.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.480
Now, let's go.

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:08.860
Yeah.

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:13.820
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:16.700
Turn the three of us into cockroaches!

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.520
Cockroaches?

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:22.390
Why do we gotta be cockroaches?

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:24.060
Don't worry about it. Let's go!

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.930
The moon is smiling tonight.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:31.580
You two! You understand, right?

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:36.640
If you let those Ojamajos sneak in here, Majo Ruka will get really angry!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:37.920
Be careful!

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:41.140
We're already in.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:48.020
Please you two, please help my dad. Please!

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.440
Please give us magic spheres.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:50.030
Please.

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:54.500
We thought you girls were coming to take the level 6 exam...

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:57.030
We can't honor your request...

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.570
Even when we kneel down like this?

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:01.720
Noooo........

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:02.500
Meanies!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:07.660
Oh well. We'll just ask around on the streets to see if they need part-time workers.

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:09.000
Okay, let's do that.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:13.420
In that case, why don't you go to the Queen's castle?

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:17.160
There is a lot of work to be done over there!

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:19.150
Thank you very much.

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:27.520
Her Majesty has given her permission.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:30.220
Yes! That's my Queen!

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:31.960
She's completely different from Mota and Motamota.

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.940
What do you want us to do?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.700
Eh!? Cutting firewood!?

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.700
A-All of these?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.940
If you don't want to, you don't have to.

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:44.160
We'll do it, we'll do it!

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:48.630
But, once we cut up all this firewood, will ya really give us magic spheres?

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:49.770
Yes.

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:51.070
How many will you give us?

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:53.090
That's up to the Queen.

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:56.810
Okay! I'll do it!

00:17:56.810 --> 00:17:58.720
Hadzuki-chan, get me the firewood!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:17:59.090
Okay.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:01.780
Doremi-chan, help hold the wood in place.

00:18:01.780 --> 00:18:02.310
Okay.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.660
Here I go.

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:12.280
Dad is an...

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.360
idiot!

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:34.400
Dad is a...

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:35.340
fool!

00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:44.430
Dad is...

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:49.280
Ai-chan, what's wrong?

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:49.900
Are you okay?

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:52.820
Ah, you're bleeding!

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:54.110
Ai-chan, switch with me!

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:55.820
Doremi-chan.

00:18:56.630 --> 00:19:00.030
I also have to protect my family from Majo Ruka's magic goods.

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:01.740
Doremi-chan.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.010
Hadzuki-chan, are you okay?

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:18.510
My hands are bleeding too.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:20.590
Let me do it again.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.290
Hadzuki-chan, you really worked hard.

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.180
I feel really good.

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:29.040
I am really glad that I'm friends with you two.

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:30.120
Me too.

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:30.890
Yer sayin' it wrong.

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:34.650
We ain't just friends, we're best friends!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:38.320
You're right. Okay, let's give it our all!

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:50.960
Finally...

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:53.720
You girls finished faster than I thought.

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:56.420
As promised, here are the magic spheres from the Queen.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:59.090
Here, here, here.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:01.800
Eh!? That's all!?

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:04.570
One is enough...

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:06.720
All of you pass the level 6 exam...

00:20:07.230 --> 00:20:07.840
Eh!?

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:12.960
The level 6 exam is to see if you can find a way to get magic spheres...

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:16.440
...after you run out of them...

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:17.900
Yeah!

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:22.280
Now, let us power up your Porons...

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:26.990
Give us each of your most precious instruments...

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:29.910
Our most precious instruments?

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:32.180
We are fusing them with your Porons.

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:34.080
Come on come on, hurry up.

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:37.840
I have this harmonica.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:42.500
I have this. It's broken, but I loved to play it when I was little.

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:45.710
This is my first violin which I got when I was three.

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:48.260
I can't play it now because it's too small,

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.560
but it's still my most precious instrument.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:53.710
Well then, here we go.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:21.510
These are your new Porons...

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.510
What're these?

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:26.300
Those are new magic spheres...

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:29.220
They are three times stronger than the ones before...

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:30.560
Wow!

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:32.760
But mine's only half full.

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:35.120
Why does Ai-chan have her's filled all the way up?

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:38.690
It's because she really loved her harmonica...

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:42.650
It's probably because I left that piano in the closet this entire time.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:47.100
But with these magic spheres, we can disable Majo Ruka's magic goods.

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:48.420
That's right.

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:51.330
Maybe we can even take back the Maho-dou.

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:54.330
Alright, we'll definitely do it!

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.390
Yeah!

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:02.710
Big news!

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:05.850
I heard that Majo Ruka lost her Crystal!

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:06.760
That's a good chance for us!

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:10.800
And when we use our new Porons, our magic powers are three times as powerful!

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:11.470
That's right!

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:13.820
Can the three of us defeat her while working together?

00:22:13.820 --> 00:22:18.920
After she took over the Maho-dou, we had to work so hard every day.

00:22:18.920 --> 00:22:20.440
But that will end today!

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:22.860
Now, Majo Ruka, let's end this!

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:24.340
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.340 --> 00:22:26.570
Majo Ruka VS Level 6 Ojamajos!

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:29.260
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
